      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not define or explain what “equal weighting” means (e.g., giving each factor the same importance); it only states that “coefficient of variation and equal weighting methods were used” to construct comprehensive growth monitoring indicators.",
        "The specific claim that equal weighting is used to build a “comprehensive growth indicator from separate growth measures” is only partially supported: the packet supports constructing CGMI from separate single-growth indicators (SPAD, AGB, PH, LAI), but it does not explicitly connect “equal weighting” to that exact purpose in the way the definition states."
